--make .wgt file production:
    # From project root
    ng build --output-path=./tizen/www --configuration production

    # Go to tizen project
    cd tizen

    # Build web
    tizen build-web

    # Package web app (THIS IS FINAL)
    tizen package -t wgt --sign Demo_Project
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

--Client prerequisites:

    Developer Mode ON (Apps → 1-2-3-4-5)

    Laptop + TV on same Wi-Fi

    Tizen CLI installed

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔌 Client connects to TV:

    sdb connect <TV_IP>

    sdb devices

-0-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📦 Client installs app:
Place IQ WORLD PLAYER.wgt in any folder, then:

    tizen install -n "IQ WORLD PLAYER.wgt"

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
🪟 WINDOWS Tizen CLI Installation
1️⃣ Download :

    Click:

        tizen-studio_x.x.x_windows.exe


2️⃣ Install :

    Double-click the .exe

    When installer opens:

        ✅ Select CLI Tools

        ❌ Uncheck Emulator

        ❌ Uncheck Samples

    Install path (default is fine):

        C:\tizen-studio


Click Install → wait → Finish.


3️⃣ OPEN COMMAND PROMPT (THIS IS IMPORTANT) :

    Press Windows + R

    Type:

        cmd

    Press Enter

    This black window = where all commands run.


4️⃣ VERIFY INSTALLATION :

    In Command Prompt, type:

        tizen version


    ✅ Expected output:

    Tizen CLI x.x.x


🎉 Tizen CLI installed successfully


++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

🐧 LINUX Tizen CLI Installation(Ubuntu)
1️⃣ Download : 

    Click:

        tizen-studio_x.x.x_linux.bin

2️⃣ Install :

    Open Terminal and go to Downloads:

        cd ~/Downloads
        chmod +x tizen-studio_*.bin
        ./tizen-studio_*.bin


    Installer opens:

    ✅ Select CLI Tools only

    ❌ Skip Emulator

3️⃣ ADD TO PATH :

    export PATH=$PATH:$HOME/tizen-studio/tools

4️⃣ VERIFY :

    tizen version